      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Damping identifies the correct pointwise target and smoothing preserves fixed-coordinate limits while making remote tails estimable, but neither supplies Hilbert-norm convergence without additional domination; the coordinate formulation localizes the remaining mass to a moving intermediate range.",
